# RansomShield AI — Frontend Environment Configuration
# By default, leave these commented out to automatically connect to the backend
# on the current host (works for localhost, 127.0.0.1, and LAN IPs like 10.243.216.187).
# Explicitly uncomment and set these only if your backend is hosted on a separate remote domain.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
# VITE_WS_BASE_URL=ws://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/ws
